    \item \textbf{Transformative Potential:} LLMs will fundamentally reshape clinical workflows and education.
    \item \textbf{Critical Gaps Remain:} Benchmark success does not guarantee real-world safety; hallucinations pose a severe risk.
    \item \textbf{Action Required:} Deployment must prioritize evidence, equity, and robust governance to protect patient safety.
  \end{itemize}
}

\end{tcbposter}
\end{document}

